# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  § 3 — تهيئة الأجهزة الطرفية
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# الأجهزة الطرفية تتوقف على IDT و PIC (من § 2).
#
# PS/2 Keyboard (IRQ1):
#   - Controller: 8042 PS/2 at ports 0x60 (data) / 0x64 (status/cmd)
#   - Commands: 0xAA (Self-Test), 0xF4 (Enable Scanning)
#   - Scan Code Set 1: 0x01=Esc, 0x1C=Enter, 0x1E=A, 0x39=Space
#   - Key Down: scan < 0x80 | Key Up: scan + 0x80
#   - Modifiers: 0x2A=LShift, 0x1D=LCtrl, 0x38=LAlt
#
# PS/2 Mouse (IRQ12):
#   - Enable: 0x64←0xA8 (enable aux port), 0x64←0xD4 0x60←0xF4
#   - Packet: 3 bytes [Buttons|XSign|YSign|XOvf|YOvf] [dX] [dY]
#   - Bit 0 = Left Button, Bit 1 = Right, Bit 2 = Middle
#   - Movement: signed 8-bit delta X and Y
#
# PIT Timer (IRQ0):
#   - Chip: Intel 8253/8254 Programmable Interval Timer
#   - Channel 0: OUT(0x43, 0x34) — mode 2, lobyte/hibyte
#   - Frequency: 1193182 / 11932 ≈ 100 Hz (10ms per tick)
#   - OUT(0x40, LSB), OUT(0x40, MSB)
#
# Network:
#   - PCI scan for NIC (Class 0x02, Subclass 0x00)
#   - Common: RTL8139 (RealTek), e1000 (Intel)
#   - QEMU default: Intel e1000 MAC=52:54:00:12:34:56
#   - Stack: Ethernet → ARP → IPv4 → TCP/UDP → DHCP/DNS/HTTP

